        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy Recraft V4- Style-Reference Image Generation\n\nGenerate images in the style of one or more reference images using Recraft V4 Styles, capturing texture, composition, and rendering without any training or fine-tuning. Feed in multiple reference images to sharpen or broaden the style match, and receive a single styled output. Ideal for brand-consistent asset creation, matching a client's existing campaign look, or adapting styles from any external image source. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs Comfy Cloud partner credits.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/api_recraft_v4_style_reference.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
